// Users must manage risk, position sizing, and verify all signals with broader
// market context, news, liquidity, and their own trading plan before acting.
// Past performance of any signal pattern does not imply future results.
// Technical Entry / Invalidation / Reward-to-Risk estimates do NOT execute trades.
